TSP_CSHARP_DOCUMENTATION

This DLL file was originally implemented in one of the Mods I inherited, but I don't know how it works. All I can tell you is that it added several useful features for Biomes, and in V1.4, those looked like the following.

<li Class="RockSettings.DefModExtension_BiomeSettings">
	<rockCount>1~2</rockCount>
	<allowedRockDefs Inherit="False">
		<li>ST_MudStone</li>
		<li MayRequire="sarg.alphabiomes">AB_Mudstone</li>
	</allowedRockDefs>
</li>